  "body": "MOTIVATED VENDOR - GENUINE BUYERS ENCOURAGED\r\nIf you've been watching this property, now is the time to come and take a closer look.\r\nBeautifully refreshed and well maintained, this spacious family home delivers immediate comfort, style and versatility, while offering an exciting opportunity to transform the outdoors into something truly extraordinary.\r\nFreshly redecorated inside and out and thoughtfully designed for comfortable family living, the home's versatile layout provides excellent separation of living spaces ideal for growing families, entertaining guests or simply enjoying everyday life.\r\nSet on a generous 727m² (more or less) fully fenced section, the expansive backyard is a rare blank canvas. Imagine creating beautifully landscaped gardens, a resort-inspired entertaining area, a swimming pool oasis, or simply a safe and spacious haven for children and pets to enjoy.\r\nWith the hard work already done inside, there is plenty of scope to put your own stamp on the outdoors and create a home that continues to evolve with your family's needs.\r\n\r\nProperty features:\r\n4 generous bedrooms\r\n2 bathrooms\r\n2 separate lounges providing flexible family living\r\nDouble car garaging plus additional off-street parking\r\nLarge entertaining deck flowing to expansive lawns\r\nFreshly redecorated inside and out\r\nGenerous, fully fenced 727m² (more or less) section\r\nExcellent potential to further enhance the outdoor living and entertaining areas\r\n\r\nConstruction information\r\nFor buyers wanting clarity around the home's construction, the exterior cladding is brick with a cavity EIFS-style monolithic plaster system using MPT Meshlath over 40mm expanded polystyrene.\r\nSupplier documentation available in the property file confirms H3.1 LOSP-treated timber framing was supplied for the home. The relevant documentation is available for prospective purchasers to review as part of their due diligence.\r\n\r\nConveniently positioned close to Wentworth College, local shops and transport options, the location also provides easy access to:\r\nFerry services into downtown Auckland, Penlink connection, expected to be completed around 2029\r\nBeaches and coastal walkways, Golf courses, Marina facilities, Ready for its next chapter.\r\n\r\nOur vendor is motivated to achieve a successful sale and is encouraging genuine buyers to engage.\r\nIf you've been considering this property, don't simply watch it online come and experience the space, the layout and the potential for yourself.\r\n\r\n\r\nContact Mel or Sam today to arrange a private viewing or visit our Open Home.\r\n\r\nTo view the property documents copy this link into your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/ZDNQ",
